      "description": "Ação principal: azul-tinta, texto branco, canto de 6px.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn-primary\">Acompanhar evento</button>",
      "css": ".ds-btn-primary{background:#10233F;color:#fff;border:1px solid #10233F;border-radius:6px;padding:9px 16px;font:700 14px Archivo,'Segoe UI',system-ui,sans-serif;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s ease}.ds-btn-primary:hover{background:#1B355C}.ds-btn-primary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #1D4F91;outline-offset:2px}"
