      "refersTo": "verdict-band",
      "description": "Topo da Situação agora, na cor do grau mais alto, com selo carimbado e frase de despacho.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-verdict\"><span class=\"ds-verdict-grade\">Crítico</span><h1>Segurar cargas pela BR-116 sentido sul</h1><p>2 trechos bloqueados · Dados de 14:00</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-verdict{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;gap:6px 20px;align-items:center;padding:18px 24px;background:#C8201A;color:#fff;font-family:Archivo,'Segoe UI',system-ui,sans-serif;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-verdict-grade{grid-row:span 2;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;border:2px solid currentColor;border-radius:4px;padding:6px 10px}.ds-verdict h1{margin:0;font-size:clamp(20px,2vw,27px);font-weight:800;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-.01em}.ds-verdict p{margin:0;font-size:15px;opacity:.92}"
    },
    {
