      "refersTo": "aviso-row",
      "description": "Uma ocorrência por linha: coluna de grau de 6px, código EV, trecho, título, despacho e justificativa.",
      "html": "<ul class=\"ds-avisos\"><li class=\"ds-aviso\" style=\"--g:#C8201A\"><div><div class=\"ds-aviso-meta\"><b>EV-0412</b><span>BR-116 km 230 · SP</span><span>Bloqueio</span><span>há 40 min</span></div><p class=\"ds-aviso-title\">Pista interditada após tombamento de carreta</p><p class=\"ds-aviso-do\">Segurar saídas pelo trecho até liberação.</p><details class=\"ds-aviso-why\"><summary>Por que crítico?</summary><p>Bloqueio total é sempre Crítico.</p></details></div></li></ul>",
      "css": ".ds-avisos{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;background:#fff;border:1px solid #CAD2DC;font-family:Archivo,'Segoe UI',system-ui,sans-serif;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-aviso{display:grid;grid-template-columns:6px 1fr;border-bottom:1px solid #E2E7ED}.ds-aviso::before{content:'';background:var(--g)}.ds-aviso>div{padding:12px 18px 14px;display:grid;gap:4px}.ds-aviso-meta{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px 12px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#536177}.ds-aviso-meta b{color:#10233F}.ds-aviso-title{margin:0;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.35;color:#10233F}.ds-aviso-do{margin:0;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:#10233F}.ds-aviso-why{font-size:13px;color:#536177}.ds-aviso-why summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:700;color:#1D4F91}.ds-aviso-why p{margin:4px 0 0}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Régua de vigência",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "regua-band",
      "description": "Banda por trecho do primeiro registro até agora; cauda esmaecida = sem previsão.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-regua\"><div class=\"ds-regua-label\"><b>BR-116 km 230</b><small>SP · sul</small></div><div class=\"ds-regua-track\"><div class=\"ds-band\" style=\"left:30%;width:45%\">Crítico · 5h</div><div class=\"ds-tail\" style=\"left:75%;width:25%\"></div><div class=\"ds-now\" style=\"left:75%\"><span>agora</span></div></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-regua{display:grid;grid-template-columns:148px 1fr;font-family:Archivo,'Segoe UI',system-ui,sans-serif;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;background:#fff;color:#10233F;padding:8px 0}.ds-regua-label{padding:8px 10px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #E2E7ED}.ds-regua-label b{display:block;font-size:14px}.ds-regua-label small{font-size:12px;color:#536177;font-weight:600}.ds-regua-track{position:relative;min-height:46px;border-bottom:1px solid #E2E7ED;background-image:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,#E2E7ED 0 1px,transparent 1px calc(100% / 5))}.ds-band{position:absolute;top:11px;height:24px;line-height:24px;padding:0 8px;border-radius:3px 0 0 3px;background:#C8201A;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden}.ds-tail{position:absolute;top:11px;height:24px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(200,32,26,.45),rgba(200,32,26,0))}.ds-now{position:absolute;top:0;bottom:0;width:2px;background:#10233F}.ds-now span{position:absolute;top:-2px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);padding:0 4px;background:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;line-height:18px}"
    },
